IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `maireg-dates`
IMPORT `maireg-costs`

-- Motor Accident Injuries Regulation 2017 (NSW) -- worked cases for every exported question in maireg-costs.l4.
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text (monetary units from the Schedule 3 editorial note,
-- rounded under Sch 3 cl 3); none was copied from the encoding's output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on
-- stated facts, not about the law. Dates and amounts are illustrative.
-- BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases`

`d` MEANS `the date`

-- 1 November 2024 is in the 2024-25 adjustment year: a monetary unit is $124.53.
`in 2024-25` MEANS `d` 1 11 2024

