#ASSERT `Who pays the costs after I rejected the assessed damages` FALSE 100000 100000 FALSE EQUALS `I must pay the costs any party incurred, up to the cap`
-- Certificate $100,000: the insurer pays from an excess of $20,000 (20% beats $2,000).
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs after I rejected the assessed damages` FALSE 100000 119999 FALSE EQUALS `the insurer and I each pay our own costs`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs after I rejected the assessed damages` FALSE 100000 120000 FALSE EQUALS `the insurer must pay the costs any party incurred`
