#ASSERT `Who pays the costs after I rejected the assessed damages` FALSE 2000000 2199999 FALSE EQUALS `the insurer and I each pay our own costs`
#ASSERT `Who pays the costs after I rejected the assessed damages` FALSE 2000000 2200000 FALSE EQUALS `the insurer must pay the costs any party incurred`

